# Zuko, Conflicted's fourth mode: "Exile Zuko, then return him to the battlefield under an opponent's control." Bot1 loses 2 life (18)
# and Zuko comes back under Bot2's control, a new object that has chosen nothing (CR 400.7): in Bot2's own first main phase (turn 4) his
# trigger is Bot2's, who makes all the choices - Bot2 draws (loses 2 life, 18) while Bot1 draws and loses nothing.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Jet
Mox Ruby
Zuko, Conflicted
Swamp x20

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x23

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Zuko, Conflicted.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Modes(Exile Zuko)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
? Bot1.Life = 18
? Bot1.Battlefield = Mox Jet; Mox Ruby
[T4 Bot2.Main1]
? Bot2.Battlefield.Zuko, Conflicted.Types = Creature
Bot2.Modes(Draw a card)
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Pass

[Expect]
Bot2.Life = 18
Bot1.Life = 18
Bot2.Battlefield.Zuko, Conflicted.ChosenModes = 1
